    "background_story": "Ellie was a brilliant and fearless astrophysicist who defied convention to unlock the secrets of the universe. Her groundbreaking research on interstellar travel and energy production earned her both acclaim and notoriety. Dubbed 'the modern Prometheus' by her peers, Ellie's work challenged the status quo and pushed the boundaries of human knowledge. Her most ambitious project, codenamed 'Erebus,' aimed to harness the power of black holes to create limitless clean energy. Though the scientific community was skeptical, Ellie persevered, driven by her vision of a brighter future for humanity. As she stood on the threshold of a major breakthrough, Ellie's courage and conviction inspired a new generation of scientists and explorers to follow in her footsteps, just as the titan Prometheus had defied the gods to bring fire to humanity.",
